# Startup Optimization Anti-Patterns

## Loading all services at startup — slow cold start

```java
// WRONG — 10 services instantiated before first frame
public void init() {
    new ReportService(); // 500ms
    new ExportService(); // 300ms
    new SyncService();   // 200ms
    // ... user waits 3 seconds
}
```

**Lazy-init services on first use. Show splash screen while Ebean initializes.**

## No AppCDS — slower startup every launch

```java
// WRONG — classes re-linked every time
// Fix: build CDS archive
// java -Xshare:on -XX:SharedArchiveFile=app.jsa -jar app.jar
```

**Generate CDS archive once, ship with app. 30-40% faster startup.**

## Large CSS files loaded at startup

```java
// WRONG — 200KB CSS parsed on every launch
```

**Compile to binary with Css2Bin at build time. Smaller + faster parsing.